    {
      "id": "claim_8c7938b2aeb7424399694557826b6239",
      "statement": "The out-of-band flow sets redirect_uri to urn:ietf:wg:oauth:2.0:oob, prints the authorization URL for a browser on another machine, reads the pasted verification code from stdin, and exchanges it, surfacing provider error/error_description values.",
