    {
      "id": "claim_19c18618fc364cf796226f19f165e40e",
      "statement": "DoJWTAuthorization (--jwt) returns the signed JWT itself (aud=scope target, sub=issuer, kid=client ID, RS256, 3600s expiry) without any network call, for APIs accepting JWT bearer authentication directly.",
