    {
      "id": "claim_85e569f154f34a8aa60555639f23d5bd",
      "statement": "CA OIDC provisioning obtains its identity token by re-executing the step binary via exec.Step with 'oauth --oidc --bare', the provisioner's configuration endpoint as --provider, its client credentials, scopes, auth params, --console when requested, and --listen from the provisioner's ListenAddress unless STEP_LISTEN overrides it; the trimmed stdout is the OIDC token.",
